<title>FRANCE: French shippers council appoint new director.</title>
<headline>French shippers council appoint new director.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French shippers council, the Association des Utilisateurs de Fret (AUTF), has appointed Daphne Ehrmann as Director, International Transport.</p>
<p>Ehrmann, 27, will be responsible for sea and air freight affairs and replaces Herve Cornede who is joining French freight transport federation, the FFOCT, as Director, International Affairs and Multi-Modal Transport.</p>
<p>Ehrmann  previously worked in the legal affairs department of steel-making group, Usinor Sacilor.</p>
<p>Both Ehrmann and Cornede will take up their new posts this week.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
